-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 19.9.94 (הסתדרות המורים) — התחייבות המעסיקים לפי סעיף
-- 34ג' ל"הסכם 93": the wage agreement between the State, the Centre of Local
-- Government, the three large cities and הסתדרות המורים that carries out
-- the employers' undertaking of §34(ג) of the agreement of 11.5.93 ("הסכם
-- 93", l4/agreements/teachers-general/1993-05-11_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1993.l4,
-- imported): the value of the supplements the engineers were given. Whom it
-- covers and its period, extending "הסכם 93" (§§1–3); five new salary tables
-- from 1.1.94 to 1996, the last set by the erosion check of January 1996,
-- their update by the cost of living, compensation for inflation in 1996,
-- and "תוספת 1993" and "תוספת השהייה" inside the tables (§4); the
-- differences (§5); the erosion formula, not exhausted (§6); the school
-- in-service training of 1993 cancelled and the supervisors' leave days
-- given back (§7); "הסכם הוראה 94", 106 shekels (§8); the reward of required
-- teachers in priority localities (§9); the jubilee grant (§11); havraa
-- days (§12); the professional-development fund (§13); 2% for pension
-- (§14); in-service hours and budgets (§§15–16); the allowances —
-- counselling, split groups, intermediate, M.A. and Ph.D., in-service units,
-- first-grade educators, management and supervision, role holders (§17);
-- saving in a sabbatical (§18); pensioners (§19); five committees and the
-- sick-pay continuity owners (§§20–25); general provisions and disputes
-- (§§26–27); the annexes (§28): the five tables, cell for cell below, and
-- seven letters of the same day.
--
-- The agreement has no §10: its numbering goes from §9 to §11, which the
-- corpus marks as printed.
--
-- WHO CITES IT: the agreement of 8.9.98 (§§10–11) and the takanon's
-- sources lines name it; the Oz LaTmura agreement of 31.8.94
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994.l4)
-- is the other union's agreement on the same undertaking, with its own
-- numbering and, in places, its own terms. It speaks to the pay item `the
-- 1994 supplement of a full position` (§8) and its tables to `the combined
-- salary of a full position`, and is not in teachers-general-root.l4.
--
-- Outside the corpus: the engineers' agreement of 29.4.94, the collective
-- agreements of 28.7.84 and 24.1.89, the Director-General's circulars of
-- 1993–94 and the cost-of-living agreement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `1993-05-11_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1993`

-- not weighed against `the Sick Pay Law`: §23 only charges a joint
-- committee with drafting a sick-days fund agreement on the pattern of the
-- agreement of 24.1.89, and §24 adds owners to the continuity of the
-- compensation for unused sick days of the agreement of 11.5.93; neither
-- says anything of sick pay for an absence or of accruing sick days.

-- not weighed against `the Annual Leave Law`: §7 only gives the
-- supervisors back leave days §18 of the agreement of 11.5.93 took from
-- them and stops the deduction from 1.9.94, and §19.א.2 adds 4.5% to a
-- leave redemption already paid to a 1993 retiree; both only add to what
-- was given, and the supervisors' leave quota is the State employees',
-- outside the corpus.

-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: §§8(ב), 17(ד)(2) and
-- 17(ו)(3) count the supplements in the wage severance is computed on, and
-- §11(ב) names the salary determining severance only as the base of the
-- jubilee grant; a component counted adds to the severance and takes
-- nothing the law gives (§31).

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: "משרה מלאה" here is
-- the base of the pensioners' educator allowance, the combined salary of a
-- full position (the letter on גמול מחנך); it is no hour, day or week of
-- work.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: "ארגוני הנשים" are employers of
-- teaching employees whose teachers get the in-service hours too, and
-- "בעל ותק" and "בעל תפקיד" are one who has seniority or a role; the
-- agreement gives no pay or other remuneration by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — התחייבות המעסיקים לפי סעיף 34ג' ל"הסכם 93" (הסתדרות המורים, 19.9.1994)`

DECLARE `1994 Histadrut agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `act to apply the agreement of 19.9.94 to the owners' teaching employees`
    `pay the differences of the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `send Histadrut HaMorim the list of required teachers of 19.9.94`
    `send Histadrut HaMorim the achievements of the schools with the incentives of 19.9.94`
    `notify Histadrut HaMorim of the budget of the rewards of 19.9.94`
    `renew a required teacher's employment on the terms of 19.9.94`
    `transfer 75% of the professional-development budget to Histadrut HaMorim's fund`
    `allocate half a percent of the pension salary a year under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `transfer Histadrut HaMorim's in-service training budget of 19.9.94`
    `finish the split-allowance committee's work of 19.9.94`
    `apply the split-allowance committee's recommendations of 19.9.94 from 1.9.94`
    `finish the principals' pay committee's work of 19.9.94`
    `set the criteria for dividing the role holders of 19.9.94`
    `transfer the employers' share to the shortened fund under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `pay the pensioners their differences under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `finish the budgetary-pension erosion committee's work of 19.9.94`
    `contribute to the accrual pension from the guidance allowance of 19.9.94`
    `choose the management allowance's base under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `finish the colleges' promotion committee's work of 19.9.94`
    `follow the hours of the pedagogical centres of 19.9.94`
    `conclude the early-retirement committee's recommendations of 19.9.94`
    `draft a sick-days fund agreement under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `finish a committee's work by its set day under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `decide a committee's undecided dispute under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `strike over a matter the agreement of 19.9.94 settled`
    `lock out over a matter the agreement of 19.9.94 settled`
    `decide a dispute over the agreement of 19.9.94`
    `raise the quota of required teachers of 19.9.94 without a joint decision`
    `transfer a further million shekels to the distress fund`
    `allot the service-car slots of 19.9.94`
    `set the rules of the loan fund of 19.9.94`
    `use the role holders' quota of 19.9.94 to appoint in-service coordinators`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (15.2.96, no. 7075/94); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The State and who represents it (the wages commissioner at the Treasury and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "Side A"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 הסתדרות המורים, its secretary-general and its delegation; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "Side B"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the collective agreement of 11.5.93 ("הסכם 93") on the pay and terms of the teaching scale; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: under "הסכם 93" its cost includes the cost-of-living and framework agreements signed in the economy; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: under §34(ג) of "הסכם 93" the employers undertook, failing a public-sector framework agreement for 1993–1995, to give the teachers the value of the engineers' supplements; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: with no framework agreement, a wage agreement was made with the engineers on 29.4.94 ("הסכם המהנדסים"); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the parties negotiated to carry out the employers' undertaking under §34(ג); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: made and signed in Tel Aviv on 19 September 1994, the eve of
-- Sukkot 5755.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 9 1994

`why the engineers' agreement of 29.4.94 is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הסכם השכר בין המעסיקים להסתדרות המהנדסים מיום 29.4.94"

§§ `1 המבוא והנספחים`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the agreement of 19.9.94's preamble and annexes are part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

-- (א): it applies to the teaching employees in the teaching scale ("עו"ה").
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN `in the teaching scale` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 19.9.94 applies to a teaching employee who is` `in the teaching scale` IF
    `in the teaching scale`

-- (ב): the State, as the supervisor and funder of the "owners", acts to
-- apply it to the teaching employees they employ.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b
`applying the agreement of 19.9.94 to the owners' teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to apply the agreement of 19.9.94 to the owners' teaching employees`

-- (ג): it applies also to those on a sabbatical in the school year תשנ"ד
-- and to those on a sabbatical from תשנ"ה on.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
GIVEN `the school year of the sabbatical` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year it opens in: 1993 for תשנ"ד
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 19.9.94 applies to one on a sabbatical in` `the school year of the sabbatical` IF
    `the school year of the sabbatical` AT LEAST 1993

§§ `3 תוקף ההסכם`

-- (א): from the day "הסכם 93" took effect to 31.12.96, or to the end of
-- the engineers' agreement of 29.4.94, the later of the two: "its extended
-- period". (ב): the signing extends "הסכם 93" to the end of this one. Read
-- through "הסכם 93"'s own period (imported), which runs from 1.1.93 to
-- 31.8.95; both ends included (convention dates.end).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a
GIVEN `the engineers' agreement ends on` IS A DATE @desc the engineers' agreement of 29.4.94 is outside the corpus
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the extended period of the agreement of 19.9.94 ends on` `the engineers' agreement ends on` IS
    IF `the engineers' agreement ends on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1996)
    THEN `the engineers' agreement ends on`
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1996

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the engineers' agreement ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the extended period of the agreement of 19.9.94` d `the engineers' agreement ends on` IF
        `in the 1993 wage agreement's period` d
    OR  (    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1995)
         AND d `is on or before` (`the extended period of the agreement of 19.9.94 ends on` `the engineers' agreement ends on`))

@ref akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the engineers' agreement ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 11.5.93 is in force under the agreement of 19.9.94 on` d `the engineers' agreement ends on` IF
    `in the extended period of the agreement of 19.9.94` d `the engineers' agreement ends on`

§§ `4 טבלאות השכר`

-- (א)(1)–(4): from 1.1.94 (the January salary) annex א' applies, from
-- 1.7.94 annex ב', from 1.1.95 annex ג', from 1.7.95 annex ד'; each from
-- its day (convention dates.start). (א)(5): from 1.4.96 (the April salary)
-- annex ה', subject to (ב).
-- F-hh-1994-b: §28's list dates annex ד' from 1.8.95; (א)(4) and the
-- table itself ("בתוקף מ- 01/07/95") from 1.7.95. The reading adopted
-- (convention precedence.specific): the clause that applies the table, and
-- the table, govern; the list names the annexes.
-- F-hh-1994-a: annex ה' is dated three ways — 1.4.96 here, 1.3.96 in §28's
-- list, and 1.1.96 in (ב)(4) and on the table itself ("בתוקף מ- 01/01/96").
-- The reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): (ב)(4), which
-- speaks of the day the table applies from, governs: the table, once
-- corrected by the erosion check, applies from 1.1.96, as it prints; 1.4.96
-- is the April salary that pays it.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_5
DECLARE `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94` IS ONE OF
    `annex א' of 19.9.94`
    `annex ב' of 19.9.94`
    `annex ג' of 19.9.94`
    `annex ד' of 19.9.94`
    `annex ה' of 19.9.94`

`the day §4(א)(4) of 19.9.94 applies annex ד' from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1995
`the day §4(א)(5) of 19.9.94 applies annex ה' from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 1996
`the day §4(ב)(4) of 19.9.94 applies the corrected annex ה' from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1996

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`
DECIDE `the annex of 19.9.94 that applies on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` `the day §4(ב)(4) of 19.9.94 applies the corrected annex ה' from` THEN JUST `annex ה' of 19.9.94`
        IF d `is on or after` `the day §4(א)(4) of 19.9.94 applies annex ד' from` THEN JUST `annex ד' of 19.9.94`
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995) THEN JUST `annex ג' of 19.9.94`
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1994) THEN JUST `annex ב' of 19.9.94`
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994) THEN JUST `annex א' of 19.9.94`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- (ב)(1): annex ה''s combined salary is set by the result of the erosion
-- check made in January 1996 — "הסכם 93"'s initial check, §8(ב)(3)
-- (imported, `the initial 1993 erosion check is made on`). (ב)(2): if its
-- result is not delivered by 31.3.96 (the day included: convention
-- dates.end), annex ה' is paid as advances with the salary of March 1996,
-- whatever the result. (ב)(3): once the check is made, its rates are added
-- to or taken from the combined salary of annex ה' — relatively (convention
-- amounts.increase), "the corrected table"; (ב)(4): it applies
-- retroactively from 1.1.96, and the advances paid are set off from it.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_4
`the erosion check annex ה' of 19.9.94 waits for is made on` MEANS `the initial 1993 erosion check is made on`

GIVEN `the check's result was delivered on` IS A MAYBE DATE @desc NOTHING while it is not delivered
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex ה' of 19.9.94 is paid as advances with the salary of March 1996` `the check's result was delivered on` IF
    CONSIDER `the check's result was delivered on`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST d THEN NOT d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 1996)

GIVEN `a cell of annex ה'` IS A NUMBER
      `the erosion result` IS A NUMBER @desc as a fraction: positive where the teachers' pay was eroded, negative where it gained
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the corrected annex ה' cell of 19.9.94` `a cell of annex ה'` `the erosion result` IS
    `a cell of annex ה'` `increased by` `the erosion result`

GIVEN `the corrected cell` IS A NUMBER, `the advances paid` IS A NUMBER @desc for the same months, from 1.1.96
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the difference the corrected annex ה' of 19.9.94 leaves` `the corrected cell` `the advances paid` IS
    `the corrected cell` MINUS `the advances paid`

-- (ג): the amounts in the tables (annexes א'–ה') are updated from 1.1.94
-- at the dates and rates of the cost-of-living increments, by the
-- cost-of-living agreement (outside the corpus; its increments are the
-- input). ¶2: the salary of the initial grade at the initial seniority is
-- updated by the increment's rate, and the rest of the table keeps the
-- gaps between grade and grade and in seniority "as this agreement set
-- them": the annexes' notes set the seniority gaps as rates, and the grades
-- stand in fixed ratios in every table (asserted below), so every cell
-- moves by the increment's rate (convention amounts.increase), each update
-- applied to the amount in force on its day (convention
-- dates.update-in-force).
-- F-hh-1994-d: annexes ד' and ה' print that they already include the
-- increments of 1.2.94 (2.3%) and 1.8.94 (3.7%), which (ג) would add again
-- to every table "from 1.1.94". The reading adopted: an increment a table
-- says it includes is not added to it again; the input is the increments
-- after those.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_c/p2
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the increments the table does not include` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc in order, from 1.1.94 or from the last increment the table prints that it includes
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a 1994 Histadrut table amount updated by the cost of living` amount `the increments the table does not include` IS
    foldl (GIVEN acc IS A NUMBER, r IS A NUMBER YIELD acc `increased by` r) amount `the increments the table does not include`

`the increments annexes ד' and ה' of 19.9.94 say they include` MEANS LIST 2.3%, 3.7%

-- (ד): if the consumer price index rises in 1996 above 11% (strictly:
-- convention thresholds.above), the teachers are paid 0.15% of the
-- combined salary for each percent of inflation above 11%, up to a ceiling
-- of 15%: whole percents (convention thresholds.per-n), 15 the most
-- counted, in (a ceiling, not a threshold). ¶2: paid by updating the
-- salary table in the salary of January 1997, from 1.9.96.
@ref akn:art_4__para_d akn:art_4__para_d/p2
`the inflation the agreement of 19.9.94 compensates above` MEANS 11%
`the inflation the agreement of 19.9.94 compensates up to` MEANS 15%
`the compensation of 19.9.94 for each percent of inflation` MEANS 0.15%

GIVEN `the CPI's rise in 1996` IS A NUMBER @desc as a fraction
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the inflation compensation rate of 19.9.94 for` `the CPI's rise in 1996` IS
    IF `the CPI's rise in 1996` `is above` `the inflation the agreement of 19.9.94 compensates above`
    THEN `the compensation of 19.9.94 for each percent of inflation` TIMES
             `whole blocks of` (1%) `in` (min `the CPI's rise in 1996` `the inflation the agreement of 19.9.94 compensates up to` MINUS `the inflation the agreement of 19.9.94 compensates above`)
    ELSE 0

`the inflation compensation of 19.9.94 applies from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1996
`the salary month the inflation compensation of 19.9.94 is paid with` MEANS LIST 1997, 1

-- (ה): from 1.1.94 the tables include "תוספת 1993" and "תוספת השהייה",
-- paid until then on a line of their own, and neither is paid apart any
-- more: "הסכם 93"'s §5(ב) supplement (imported) stops being a line of its
-- own. The status of the stay hours set in the parties' agreements is not
-- changed.
@ref akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN m IS A DATE @desc the salary month
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 supplement rate paid on its own line under the agreement of 19.9.94 on` m IS
    IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)
    THEN 0
    ELSE `the 1993 supplement rate on` m

`the agreement of 19.9.94 changes the status of the stay hours` MEANS FALSE

-- (ו): employees whose pay is tied to the teachers' tables and who were
-- not entitled to "תוספת השהייה" before have the supplement's rate, 10%,
-- set off from the table by the employers.
-- F-hh-1994-c: "the rate of the supplement" is taken off the table, and
-- the table now includes it: 10% of the table's cell, or the cell without
-- the supplement it includes, are not the same amount. The reading adopted
-- (convention amounts.base): the percentage is of the base the sentence
-- names, the table: the cell less 10% of it.
@ref akn:art_4__para_f
`the stay supplement's rate §4(ו) of 19.9.94 sets off` MEANS 10%

GIVEN `the table's cell` IS A NUMBER
      `was ever entitled to the stay supplement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the table cell under §4(ו) of 19.9.94` `the table's cell` `was ever entitled to the stay supplement` IS
    IF `was ever entitled to the stay supplement`
    THEN `the table's cell`
    ELSE `the table's cell` MINUS `the stay supplement's rate §4(ו) of 19.9.94 sets off` TIMES `the table's cell`

`the cell without the stay supplement it includes, under §4(ו) of 19.9.94` MEANS
    1000 DIVIDED BY (1 PLUS `the stay supplement's rate §4(ו) of 19.9.94 sets off`)

`§4(ו) of 19.9.94 sets off a rate whose base it does not name` MEANS
        `the table cell under §4(ו) of 19.9.94` 1000 FALSE EQUALS 900
    AND NOT `the table cell under §4(ו) of 19.9.94` 1000 FALSE EQUALS `the cell without the stay supplement it includes, under §4(ו) of 19.9.94`
    AND `the stay supplement's rate §4(ו) of 19.9.94 sets off` EQUALS `the 1993 stay supplement rate`
#ASSERT `§4(ו) of 19.9.94 sets off a rate whose base it does not name`

§§ `5 מועד תשלום ההפרשים`

