§§ `6 בדיקת שחיקה`

-- (א): the parties agree that the erosion check's formula and mechanism
-- of "הסכם 93" (§8, imported) are changed; the proposals rest on (1) a new
-- grade span as the check's base, (2) checks on the base year 1993, (3)
-- neutralising the 106 shekels by their value at the check, (4) taking the
-- Beersheba municipality out of the population checked. (ב): the signing
-- does not exhaust the amendment of the formula; it is to be exhausted in
-- another agreement attached to this one. No new formula is set here: the
-- check stays "הסכם 93"'s until then.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_a/p2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_4
`the points the proposals of 19.9.94 to change the erosion check rest on` MEANS
    LIST "מתח דרגות חדש כבסיס לבדיקת השחיקה",
         "בדיקות על-פי שנת בסיס 1993",
         "עיקור 106 ש\"ח עפ\"י ערכם בעת הבדיקה",
         "הוצאות עירית ב\"ש, מהאוכלוסיה הנבדקת"

@ref akn:art_6__para_b
`the agreement of 19.9.94 exhausts the amendment of the erosion formula` MEANS FALSE

§§ `7 השתלמויות בית ספריות`

-- (א): from 1.9.94 the school in-service training of §§6, 7, 15, 18 and 29
-- and annexes ב'–ה' of "הסכם 93" is cancelled, and the school in-service
-- supplement is no longer paid: "הסכם 93"'s rates (imported) end the day
-- before 1.9.94, so the 9.2% it set from September 1994 is never paid.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7__para_a
`the sections of the agreement of 11.5.93 the agreement of 19.9.94 cancels` MEANS LIST 6, 7, 15, 18, 29
`the annexes of the agreement of 11.5.93 the agreement of 19.9.94 cancels` MEANS LIST "ב'", "ג'", "ד'", "ה'"

GIVEN m IS A DATE @desc the salary month
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school in-service supplement rate as the agreement of 19.9.94 leaves it on` m IS
    IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994)
    THEN 0
    ELSE `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` m

-- (ב): with it, the supervisors get back the leave days §18 of "הסכם 93"
-- took: from 1.1.94 one day only is deducted from their leave pool, and
-- where two were deducted one is returned to it; ¶2: only from supervisors
-- who received the school in-service supplement. (ג): from 1.9.94 no leave
-- day is deducted from them any more.
@ref akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_b/p2 akn:art_7__para_c
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `received the school in-service supplement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the leave days deducted from a supervisor under the agreement of 19.9.94 on` d `received the school in-service supplement` IS
    IF `received the school in-service supplement`
       AND d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)
       AND d `is before 1.9.94`
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE d `is before 1.9.94` IF
    NOT (d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994))

GIVEN `days already deducted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the leave days returned to a supervisor under the agreement of 19.9.94` `days already deducted` IS
    `not below zero` (`days already deducted` MINUS 1)

-- (ד): the school in-service hours accumulated up to the cancellation go
-- into the pool of hours for the in-service allowances, by the rules of the
-- Director-General's circulars of October 1993, December 1993, March 1994
-- and June 1994 (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_7__para_d
`the accumulated school in-service hours count in the pool under the agreement of 19.9.94` MEANS TRUE

`why the Director-General's circulars of 1993–94 are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוזרי המנכ\"ל, אוקטובר 93, דצמבר 93, מרץ 94 ויוני 94 (הכללים לצבירת שעות השתלמות)"

§§ `8 תוספת "הסכם הוראה 94"`

-- (א): from 1.9.94 a supplement of 106 shekels, "הסכם הוראה 94". During
-- the agreement's period it is updated at the dates and rates of the
-- cost-of-living increments; after it, at the rates of the wage supplements
-- when given and of the cost-of-living increments: each update applies to
-- the amount in force on its day (convention dates.update-in-force), by its
-- rate (convention amounts.increase).
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8__para_a
`the "הסכם הוראה 94" supplement of 1.9.94` MEANS 106

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 19.9.94 pays "הסכם הוראה 94" on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994)

GIVEN `the rates of the updates` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc in order: the cost-of-living increments during the period, then the wage supplements and the cost-of-living increments after it
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the "הסכם הוראה 94" supplement updated by` `the rates of the updates` IS
    `a 1994 Histadrut table amount updated by the cost of living` `the "הסכם הוראה 94" supplement of 1.9.94` `the rates of the updates`

-- (ב): it is the base of the percentage allowances (save "תוספת השהייה",
-- which is in the new combined salary's table), part of the salary for
-- the hour value and the social terms, and of the salary determining
-- severance pay and pension; it has its own payslip line. (ג): it is not
-- among the salary components of the erosion check.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b akn:art_8__para_c
DECLARE `what "הסכם הוראה 94" may count for` IS ONE OF
    `a percentage allowance other than the stay supplement, for 19.9.94`
    `the stay supplement, for 19.9.94`
    `the hour value, for 19.9.94`
    `the social terms, for 19.9.94`
    `the salary determining severance pay, for 19.9.94`
    `the salary determining the pension, for 19.9.94`
    `the salary components of the erosion check, for 19.9.94`

GIVEN p IS A `what "הסכם הוראה 94" may count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `"הסכם הוראה 94" counts for` p IF
        NOT p EQUALS `the stay supplement, for 19.9.94`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `the salary components of the erosion check, for 19.9.94`

`"הסכם הוראה 94" has its own payslip line` MEANS TRUE

-- (ד): as it counts for the hour value, it is paid by the teacher's
-- position share.
@ref akn:art_8__para_d
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the rates of the updates` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `position share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `"הסכם הוראה 94" paid on` d `the rates of the updates` `position share` IS
    IF `the agreement of 19.9.94 pays "הסכם הוראה 94" on` d
    THEN (`the "הסכם הוראה 94" supplement updated by` `the rates of the updates`) `pro rata to a position of` `position share`
    ELSE 0

§§ `9 תגמול ותמרוץ עו"ה נדרשים`

-- (א): the section applies to required teachers in localities of national
-- priority area א', distress and rehabilitation neighbourhoods,
-- confrontation-line localities and localities of targeted treatment, as
-- the government defined them ("reward localities"); (ב)(2) adds the
-- development towns and distress and rehabilitation neighbourhoods outside
-- the incentive areas, by the same criteria; (ו): the Arab, Druze and
-- Bedouin sectors meeting them too (a gloss: the criteria are the
-- localities'). A closed list (convention reading.closed-list).
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_9__para_f
DECLARE `place of the reward of 19.9.94` IS ONE OF
    `a locality of national priority area א', for 19.9.94`
    `a distress or rehabilitation neighbourhood, for 19.9.94`
    `a confrontation-line locality, for 19.9.94`
    `a locality of targeted treatment, for 19.9.94`
    `a development town outside the incentive areas, for 19.9.94`
    `another place, for 19.9.94`

GIVEN p IS A `place of the reward of 19.9.94`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a reward locality of 19.9.94` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `another place, for 19.9.94`

-- (ב): incentives for skilled teachers, in the subjects and roles needed in
-- the reward localities where teachers are lacking ("a required teacher").
-- (ב)(1): one who undertakes in writing to teach at least one full school
-- year there is entitled to a reward up to the incentives a teacher in that
-- locality receives, converted to shekels by the Ministry, plus pay for
-- the travel time, by his position share. (ב)(5): only one who does not
-- live in the locality he teaches in. (ב)(3): he may renew the undertaking
-- up to three consecutive periods in all, and the employers need not grant
-- a renewal after the first year or the second; the reward is in addition
-- to his pay. (ד): the section is in force to the end of the school year
-- תשנ"ז (31.8.97, the day included: convention dates.end), renewed only by
-- both sides' consent.
@ref akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_9__para_b__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_9__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_9__para_b__subpara_5 akn:art_9__para_d
`the undertaking periods a required teacher of 19.9.94 may hold in a row` MEANS 3
`the reward of 19.9.94 is in force to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1997

GIVEN p IS A `place of the reward of 19.9.94`
      `undertook in writing a full school year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `is a required teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
      `lives in the locality he teaches in` IS A BOOLEAN
      `consecutive periods of undertaking, this one included` IS A NUMBER
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the reward of a required teacher of 19.9.94` p `undertook in writing a full school year` `is a required teacher` `lives in the locality he teaches in` `consecutive periods of undertaking, this one included` d IF
        `is a reward locality of 19.9.94` p
    AND `undertook in writing a full school year`
    AND `is a required teacher`
    AND NOT `lives in the locality he teaches in`
    AND `consecutive periods of undertaking, this one included` AT MOST `the undertaking periods a required teacher of 19.9.94 may hold in a row`
    AND d `is on or before` `the reward of 19.9.94 is in force to`

-- The most the reward is: the incentives and the travel-time pay, by the
-- position share ("ובהתאם לחלקיות משרתו" reads with the whole sentence).
GIVEN `the incentives of a teacher living there, in shekels` IS A NUMBER
      `the travel-time pay` IS A NUMBER
      `position share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most the reward of a required teacher of 19.9.94 may be` `the incentives of a teacher living there, in shekels` `the travel-time pay` `position share` IS
    (`the incentives of a teacher living there, in shekels` PLUS `the travel-time pay`) `pro rata to a position of` `position share`

`renewing a required teacher's employment of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `renew a required teacher's employment on the terms of 19.9.94`

-- (ב)(4): those employed in the arrangement are employed under the rules
-- of employment of the teachers' collective agreements and arrangements.
@ref akn:art_9__para_b__subpara_4
`the required teachers of 19.9.94 are employed under the teachers' rules` MEANS TRUE

-- (ג): each year, in October and at the latest in November, Histadrut
-- HaMorim is sent a detailed list of the teachers, institutions and
-- localities of the undertakings; at each year's end the Ministry sends it
-- data on the achievements in the schools with the incentives. (ד)¶2:
-- every July it is told the whole budget spent on the rewards. No one is
-- named to send the list; the employers employ the teachers, so the duty is
-- theirs.
@ref akn:art_9__para_c akn:art_9__para_d/p2
`sending the list of required teachers of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `send Histadrut HaMorim the list of required teachers of 19.9.94`

`sending the achievements of the incentive schools of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `send Histadrut HaMorim the achievements of the schools with the incentives of 19.9.94`

`notifying the budget of the rewards of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `notify Histadrut HaMorim of the budget of the rewards of 19.9.94`

`the months the list of required teachers of 19.9.94 is sent in` MEANS LIST 10, 11
`the month the budget of the rewards of 19.9.94 is notified in` MEANS 7

-- (ה): the reward is not counted in the wage cost frame nor in the erosion
-- check.
@ref akn:art_9__para_e
`the reward of 19.9.94 counts in the cost frame or the erosion check` MEANS FALSE

§§ `11 מענק יובל`

-- (א): from the salary of June 1995, and each year after in the same
-- month (convention dates.salary-month), a teacher with accumulated
-- teaching seniority of 30 years or more — military service included, with
-- the employers, the "owners" and in formal education — is paid a jubilee
-- grant. Years are whole years completed (convention thresholds.seniority);
-- "ומעלה" with 30 in. (ב): 60% of the salary determining pension and
-- severance, without one-time yearly payments such as clothing and havraa.
-- (ד): by his position share in that year (convention position.yearly).
@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_11__para_b akn:art_11__para_d
`the jubilee seniority of 19.9.94` MEANS 30
`the jubilee grant's share of the determining salary under 19.9.94` MEANS 60%
`the month the jubilee grant of 19.9.94 is paid with` MEANS 6

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER @desc the salary month: year and month
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the jubilee grant of 19.9.94 is paid with the salary of` y m IF
    y AT LEAST 1995 AND m EQUALS `the month the jubilee grant of 19.9.94 is paid with`

GIVEN `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc military service included, with the employers, the owners and in formal education
      `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary determining pension and severance, without one-time yearly payments
      `the position share that year` IS A NUMBER @desc the average of the year's months
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant of 19.9.94` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` `the determining salary` `the position share that year` IS
    IF `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` AT LEAST `the jubilee seniority of 19.9.94`
    THEN `the jubilee grant's share of the determining salary under 19.9.94` TIMES `the determining salary` TIMES `the position share that year`
    ELSE 0

-- (ג): a teacher whose seniority already entitled him to it in תשנ"ד is
-- paid it with the salary of November 1994.
@ref akn:art_11__para_c
`the salary month a teacher entitled in 5754 is paid the jubilee grant of 19.9.94 with` MEANS LIST 1994, 11

-- (ה): it is paid to pensioners too, as is usual for State pensioners
-- (their rule is outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_11__para_e
`the jubilee grant of 19.9.94 is paid to pensioners` MEANS TRUE

§§ `12 קצובת הבראה`

-- (א): from the school year תשנ"ה (1.9.94: convention dates.school-year)
-- a teacher has one havraa day more, by the table: the first three years
-- of work in teaching, 7 days; 4–10, 9; 11–15, 10; 16–19, 11; 20 and more,
-- 12. "3 השנים הראשונות" names the years by their order, so a row is the
-- year the teacher is in (convention thresholds.seniority).
@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12__para_a akn:art_12__para_a/t1
GIVEN `the year of teaching he is in` IS A NUMBER @desc one in the first year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa days of the table of 19.9.94 for` `the year of teaching he is in` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 20 THEN 12
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 16 THEN 11
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 11 THEN 10
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 4 THEN 9
        OTHERWISE 7

-- (ב): from the school year תשנ"ו a teacher with 25 years of seniority in
-- teaching or more has 13 days a year: whole years completed (convention
-- thresholds.seniority), "ומעלה" with 25 in.
@ref akn:art_12__para_b
GIVEN `the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year it opens in
      `whole years of teaching completed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa days the agreement of 19.9.94 gives in` `the school year` `whole years of teaching completed` IS
    IF `the school year` AT LEAST 1995 AND `whole years of teaching completed` AT LEAST 25
    THEN JUST 13
    ELSE IF `the school year` AT LEAST 1994
         THEN JUST (`the havraa days of the table of 19.9.94 for` (`whole years of teaching completed` PLUS 1))
         ELSE NOTHING

§§ `13 הקרן לקידום מקצועי`

-- (א): from 1.1.95 a fund for the teachers' professional development,
-- run as §13 of the engineers' agreement (outside the corpus) set out,
-- unless the parties agree otherwise by then. (ב): funded from the
-- employers' budget through the Ministry: for תשנ"ה a budget of 16 million
-- shekels, linked to the wage supplements and the cost-of-living increments
-- in the school years after it (the same updating, convention
-- dates.update-in-force); ¶2: 75% of it is transferred each year to
-- Histadrut HaMorim's professional-development fund.
@ref akn:art_13 akn:art_13__para_a akn:art_13__para_b akn:art_13__para_b/p2
`the professional-development fund of 19.9.94 runs from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995
`the professional-development budget of 19.9.94 for 5755` MEANS 16_000_000
`the share of the professional-development budget for Histadrut HaMorim's fund` MEANS 75%

GIVEN `the supplements and increments since 5755` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Histadrut HaMorim's yearly share of the professional-development budget of 19.9.94` `the supplements and increments since 5755` IS
    `the share of the professional-development budget for Histadrut HaMorim's fund` TIMES
        `a 1994 Histadrut table amount updated by the cost of living` `the professional-development budget of 19.9.94 for 5755` `the supplements and increments since 5755`

`transferring the professional-development share of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `transfer 75% of the professional-development budget to Histadrut HaMorim's fund`

§§ `14 הכללת רכיבים לפנסיה`

-- (א): the employers allocate 0.5% of the teachers' salary determining the
-- pension, to buy rights in an accrual pension or a provident fund, in each
-- of the agreement's years 1993 to 1996 inclusive: 2% for its period in
-- all. ¶2: the sums go to carry out the joint committee's conclusions.
-- (The agreement of 8.9.98 exhausts its contributions, §10.5.)
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_a/p2
`the share of the pension salary allocated a year under the agreement of 19.9.94` MEANS 0.5%
`the years the agreement of 19.9.94 allocates for pension rights` MEANS LIST 1993, 1994, 1995, 1996

`the share of the pension salary the agreement of 19.9.94 allocates in all` MEANS
    `the share of the pension salary allocated a year under the agreement of 19.9.94` TIMES count `the years the agreement of 19.9.94 allocates for pension rights`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Histadrut agreement action`
DECIDE `allocating for pension rights under the agreement of 19.9.94 in` y IS
    IF elem y `the years the agreement of 19.9.94 allocates for pension rights`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `allocate half a percent of the pension salary a year under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- (ב)–(ג): a joint parity committee — Histadrut HaMorim on one side; the
-- Treasury, the Ministry, the local government and the three cities on the
-- other — applies to the teachers the recommendations of the committee set
-- up under §4 and annex א' of the engineers' agreement (outside the
-- corpus), among them including components not now a pension base, within
-- the 2% budget.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_c
`why the engineers' committee's pension recommendations are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "המלצות הוועדה שהוקמה מכוח סעיף 4 ונספח א' להסכם עם הסתדרות המהנדסים מיום 29.4.94"

§§ `15 השתלמויות`

-- (א): the grants of in-service hours grow by 3,000 hours in three
-- installments of 1,000 a year from the school year תשנ"ה (1.9.94: convention
-- dates.school-year); ¶2: they are given to all the teachers, in the
-- Ministry of Labour, the women's organisations and the other owners too.
@ref akn:art_15 akn:art_15__para_a akn:art_15__para_a/p2
GIVEN `the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the in-service hours the agreement of 19.9.94 has added by` `the school year` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the school year` AT LEAST 1996 THEN 3000
        IF `the school year` EQUALS 1995 THEN 2000
        IF `the school year` EQUALS 1994 THEN 1000
        OTHERWISE 0

-- (ב): continuing the State's undertaking in the agreement of 28.7.84
-- (outside the corpus) to help Histadrut HaMorim train teachers, the
-- Ministry's allocation for it grows to 1.5 million shekels a year, as at
-- the signing, transferred by the plans submitted to the Ministry.
@ref akn:art_15__para_b
`Histadrut HaMorim's in-service training budget of 19.9.94` MEANS 1_500_000

`transferring Histadrut HaMorim's in-service training budget of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `transfer Histadrut HaMorim's in-service training budget of 19.9.94`

§§ `16 ועדה פריטטית עליונה`

-- A sum of 0.1% of the teachers' wage cost ("about 8 million shekels": a
-- gloss) is put at the disposal of the supreme parity committee for the
-- teachers' terms of service.
@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16/p1
`the share of the teachers' wage cost for the supreme parity committee of 19.9.94` MEANS 0.1%

GIVEN `the teachers' wage cost` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supreme parity committee's sum of 19.9.94` `the teachers' wage cost` IS
    `the share of the teachers' wage cost for the supreme parity committee of 19.9.94` TIMES `the teachers' wage cost`

§§ `17 גמולים`

-- (א): from 1.9.94 the counselling allowance's rates are: in the first
-- year of seniority in counselling 5%, the second 6%, the third 7%, the
-- fourth 8%, the fifth and on 9%. "שנת ותק ראשונה" is the year he is in
-- (convention thresholds.seniority).
@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_a/p2 akn:art_17__para_a/t1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the year of counselling he is in` IS A NUMBER @desc one in the first year
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the counselling allowance rate of 19.9.94 on` d `the year of counselling he is in` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994)
    THEN JUST (BRANCH
                   IF `the year of counselling he is in` `has reached the row from` 5 THEN 9%
                   IF `the year of counselling he is in` EQUALS 4 THEN 8%
                   IF `the year of counselling he is in` EQUALS 3 THEN 7%
                   IF `the year of counselling he is in` EQUALS 2 THEN 6%
                   OTHERWISE 5%)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- (ב)(1): a joint committee, to raise the number of teachers entitled to
-- the split allowance for learning groups, within the agreed cost (16
-- million shekels for both organisations); (ב)(2): it finishes by 31.12.94
-- (the day included: convention dates.end), and its recommendations apply
-- retroactively from 1.9.94.
@ref akn:art_17__para_b akn:art_17__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_17__para_b__subpara_2
`the agreed cost of the split allowance of 19.9.94 for both organisations` MEANS 16_000_000

`finishing the split-allowance committee of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `finish the split-allowance committee's work of 19.9.94`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on`
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           MUST  `apply the split-allowance committee's recommendations of 19.9.94 from 1.9.94`)

-- (ג): 250 intermediate allowances more in תשנ"ה and 250 more in תשנ"ו —
-- 500 in all, for both organisations — beyond those of §12(ב) of "הסכם 93"
-- (500 in תשנ"ד and 500 in תשנ"ה, imported).
@ref akn:art_17__para_c akn:art_17__para_c/p2
`the intermediate allowances the agreement of 19.9.94 adds in 5755` MEANS 250
`the intermediate allowances the agreement of 19.9.94 adds in 5756` MEANS 250

-- (ד)(1): teachers holding a master's or a doctor's degree, certified to
-- teach in any way, get an allowance of 5% of the combined salary for the
-- master's and 10% for the doctorate. (ד)(2): it counts as salary for the
-- hour value, social contributions, severance and pension, on a payslip
-- line of its own. (ד)(3): by the parity committee's past decision, it
-- applies to holders of equivalent salary grades too.
@ref akn:art_17__para_d akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_3
DECLARE `degree of 19.9.94` IS ONE OF
    `a master's degree or its equivalent grade, for 19.9.94`
    `a doctor's degree or its equivalent grade, for 19.9.94`
    `no higher degree, for 19.9.94`

GIVEN g IS A `degree of 19.9.94`
      `certified to teach` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the degree allowance rate of 19.9.94` g `certified to teach` IS
    IF `certified to teach`
    THEN (CONSIDER g
          WHEN `a master's degree or its equivalent grade, for 19.9.94` THEN 5%
          WHEN `a doctor's degree or its equivalent grade, for 19.9.94` THEN 10%
          WHEN `no higher degree, for 19.9.94` THEN 0)
    ELSE 0

`the degree allowance of 19.9.94 counts for the hour value, severance and pension` MEANS TRUE

-- (ה): two more units of in-service allowance: the ceiling is 15 units in
-- תשנ"ז and 16 in תשנ"ח — "הסכם 93"'s 14 (§12, imported) and two more.
@ref akn:art_17__para_e akn:art_17__para_e/p2
GIVEN `the year the school year opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the ceiling of in-service allowance units under the agreement of 19.9.94 in` `the year the school year opens in` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the year the school year opens in` AT LEAST 1997 THEN 16
        IF `the year the school year opens in` EQUALS 1996 THEN 15
        OTHERWISE `the 1993 ceiling of in-service allowance units in` `the year the school year opens in`

-- (ו)(1): first-grade class educators get an allowance of 6.5% of the
-- combined salary; (ו)(2): in addition to the educator's allowance every
-- class educator has; (ו)(3): it counts as salary for the hour value,
-- social contributions, severance and pension, on a payslip line of its
-- own.
@ref akn:art_17__para_f akn:art_17__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_17__para_f__subpara_2 akn:art_17__para_f__subpara_3
`the first-grade educator's allowance rate of 19.9.94` MEANS 6.5%

GIVEN `educates a first grade` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the educator's allowance rate` IS A NUMBER @desc every class educator's, set elsewhere
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a class educator's allowance rates under the agreement of 19.9.94` `educates a first grade` `the educator's allowance rate` IS
    IF `educates a first grade`
    THEN `the educator's allowance rate` PLUS `the first-grade educator's allowance rate of 19.9.94`
    ELSE `the educator's allowance rate`

-- (ז)(1): the management and supervision allowances grow by 2.5% from
-- 1.9.94 (relatively: convention amounts.increase). (ז)(2): the joint
-- committee on the principals' pay and work unit finishes by 31.12.94;
-- (ז)(3): if it reaches no joint recommendations by then, they grow by 5%
-- from 1.1.95, instead of 2.5% — 5% over the allowance of the eve in all.
-- (ז)(4): the guidance roles' allowances and the kindergarten teachers'
-- coordination allowances grow with them. (ז)(5): if the committee sets
-- another rate or arrangement, it takes the place of these.
@ref akn:art_17__para_g akn:art_17__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_17__para_g__subpara_2 akn:art_17__para_g__subpara_3 akn:art_17__para_g__subpara_4 akn:art_17__para_g__subpara_5
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the committee reached joint recommendations by 31.12.94` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the update of the management allowances of 19.9.94 on` d `the committee reached joint recommendations by 31.12.94` IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995) AND NOT `the committee reached joint recommendations by 31.12.94` THEN 5%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) THEN 2.5%
        OTHERWISE 0

DECLARE `allowance §17(ז) of 19.9.94 updates` IS ONE OF
    `a management allowance, for 19.9.94`
    `a supervision allowance, for 19.9.94`
    `a guidance role's allowance, for 19.9.94`
    `a kindergarten teacher's coordination allowance, for 19.9.94`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS AN `allowance §17(ז) of 19.9.94 updates`
      `the allowance on the eve` IS A NUMBER
      `the committee reached joint recommendations by 31.12.94` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the committee set another rate or arrangement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `an allowance under §17(ז) of 19.9.94 on` d a `the allowance on the eve` `the committee reached joint recommendations by 31.12.94` `the committee set another rate or arrangement` IS
    IF `the committee set another rate or arrangement`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (`the allowance on the eve` `increased by` (`the update of the management allowances of 19.9.94 on` d `the committee reached joint recommendations by 31.12.94`))

`finishing the principals' pay committee of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `finish the principals' pay committee's work of 19.9.94`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on`

-- (ח)(1): from תשנ"ה, 4,000 role holders more in primary and junior high
