@ref akn:art_17__para_h akn:art_17__para_h__subpara_1 akn:art_17__para_h__subpara_2
`the role holders the agreement of 19.9.94 adds` MEANS 4000
`the role holders of 19.9.94 every primary school and junior high has at least` MEANS 1
`the coordination allowance rate of the role holders of 19.9.94` MEANS 5%

`setting the criteria for the role holders of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `set the criteria for dividing the role holders of 19.9.94`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on`

§§ `18 קרן השתלמות בשנת שבתון`

-- ¶1: a teacher on a sabbatical at the study fund's expense who works part
-- time that year may save in the shortened fund ("מקור"); the employers
-- transfer their share for the part position, 7.5% of his salary, against
-- his 2.5%; the arrangements for those employed half a position or more
-- stand. ¶2: subject to the approvals of the income-tax and capital-market
-- divisions of the Treasury, where needed.
@ref akn:art_18 akn:art_18/p1 akn:art_18/p2
`the employers' share in the shortened fund in a sabbatical, under 19.9.94` MEANS 7.5%
`the teacher's share in the shortened fund in a sabbatical, under 19.9.94` MEANS 2.5%

GIVEN `in a sabbatical year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed part time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `chose to save` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved where approval is needed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Histadrut agreement action`
DECIDE `transferring to the shortened fund in a sabbatical, under 19.9.94` `in a sabbatical year` `employed part time` `chose to save` `approved where approval is needed` IS
    IF `in a sabbatical year` AND `employed part time` AND `chose to save` AND `approved where approval is needed`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `transfer the employers' share to the shortened fund under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `19 גמלאים`

-- (א)(1): the agreement applies to the pensioners on a budgetary pension.
@ref akn:art_19 akn:art_19__para_a akn:art_19__para_a__subpara_1
`the agreement of 19.9.94 applies to budgetary pensioners` MEANS TRUE

-- (א)(2): pensioners who retired during 1993 have the payments made to
-- them for redeemed leave, sick-leave compensation and the statutory
-- retirement grant updated by 4.5% (convention amounts.increase). (א)(3):
-- for those who retired during 1994 the payments are updated by those
-- this agreement sets; the computation is made at once, and the
-- differences paid with the salary of October 1994, at the latest with
-- that of November 1994 (by 30.11.94).
@ref akn:art_19__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_19__para_a__subpara_3
`the update of the 1993 retirees' payments under 19.9.94` MEANS 4.5%

GIVEN `retired in` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year
      `the payment made` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 retiree's difference under the agreement of 19.9.94` `retired in` `the payment made` IS
    IF `retired in` EQUALS 1993
    THEN (`the payment made` `increased by` `the update of the 1993 retirees' payments under 19.9.94`) MINUS `the payment made`
    ELSE 0

`paying the pensioners their differences of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the pensioners their differences under the agreement of 19.9.94`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on`

-- (א)(4): a joint parity committee — the wages commissioner, the Ministry,
-- the Centre of Local Government and the three cities on one side; the
-- secretary-general of Histadrut HaMorim and the chair of the secondary
-- teachers' organisation on the other — examines the erosion of the
-- budgetary pensions, finishing by 1.2.95 (the day included).
@ref akn:art_19__para_a__subpara_4
`finishing the budgetary-pension erosion committee of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MUST  `finish the budgetary-pension erosion committee's work of 19.9.94`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 1995) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on`

-- (ב)(1): from 1.9.94 the guidance allowance is part of the salary
-- determining the pension of teachers in guidance roles who retire, if
-- they received it throughout their last two years before retiring.
-- (ב)(2): employers whose teachers are insured in an accrual pension
-- contribute to the fund from these allowances too, from 1.9.94.
@ref akn:art_19__para_b akn:art_19__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_19__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE
      `received the guidance allowance throughout the last two years` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the guidance allowance determines the pension under 19.9.94` `retired on` `received the guidance allowance throughout the last two years` IF
    `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) AND `received the guidance allowance throughout the last two years`

`contributing to the accrual pension from the guidance allowance of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `contribute to the accrual pension from the guidance allowance of 19.9.94`

-- (ג)(1): principals who retired before the school year תשנ"ד (1.9.93)
-- may choose between the management allowance computed on their personal
-- combined salary and the one computed on the combined salary of a
-- certified teacher (ממ"ס) at the top of the seniority, "by the higher of
-- the two". (ג)(2): the choice is made within 4 months of the signing (by
-- 19.1.95, the day included: convention dates.end); once the principal
-- gives notice of it, the allowance is paid retroactively from 1.3.94. The
-- choice is made once.
@ref akn:art_19__para_c akn:art_19__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_19__para_c__subpara_2
`the days the agreement of 19.9.94 gives a retired principal to choose` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 19 1 1995) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the agreement of 19.9.94 was signed on`
`a retired principal's chosen allowance of 19.9.94 is paid from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 1994
`a retired principal may change the choice of 19.9.94` MEANS FALSE

GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Histadrut agreement action`
DECIDE `a retired principal choosing the base under the agreement of 19.9.94` `retired on` IS
    IF NOT `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MAY   `choose the management allowance's base under the agreement of 19.9.94`
         WITHIN `the days the agreement of 19.9.94 gives a retired principal to choose`
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `chose in time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `on his personal combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `on a certified teacher's at the top of the seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a retired principal's management allowance under 19.9.94` `chose in time` `on his personal combined salary` `on a certified teacher's at the top of the seniority` IS
    IF `chose in time`
    THEN max `on his personal combined salary` `on a certified teacher's at the top of the seniority`
    ELSE `on his personal combined salary`

