§§ `26 הוראות כלליות`

-- (א): the agreement fully exhausts the parties' claims on what it settles,
-- for its period — save the matters the wages commissioner's letter of the
-- same day names as not exhausted (below), and the erosion formula §6(ב)
-- leaves open. ¶2: if the value of the engineers' agreement changes while
-- this one is in force, the supplements are given to the teachers.
@ref akn:art_26 akn:art_26__para_a
GIVEN `the matter` IS A STRING, d IS A DATE, `the extended period ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 19.9.94 exhausts the claims on` `the matter` d `the extended period ends on` IF
        NOT elem `the matter` `the matters the agreement of 19.9.94 does not exhaust`
    AND d `is on or before` `the extended period ends on`

@ref akn:art_26__para_a/p2
GIVEN `the engineers' agreement's value changed in the period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the engineers' change is given to the teachers under 19.9.94` `the engineers' agreement's value changed in the period` IF
    `the engineers' agreement's value changed in the period`

-- (ב): the terms set before between the parties stand for the agreement's
-- period, unless amended or cancelled by it, expressly or by implication.
-- (ג): the labour disputes declared on its matters are void on its
-- signing. (ד): during its period no side strikes or locks out, in full or
-- in part, nor harms the work in an organised way, over the matters it
-- exhausted.
@ref akn:art_26__para_b
`the earlier terms the agreement of 19.9.94 does not change stand` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_26__para_c
`the labour disputes on the matters of 19.9.94 stand` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:art_26__para_d
`no strike under the agreement of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike over a matter the agreement of 19.9.94 settled`

`no lock-out under the agreement of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `lock out over a matter the agreement of 19.9.94 settled`

