§§ `נספחים א'–ה': טבלאות השכר`

-- akn:attachments The annexes: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The Treasury's wages and labour-agreements division, as the page heads the table; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 The table's title: the combined salary in shekels a month for the teaching scale; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 "Notes"; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 The Treasury's division, as the page heads the table; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 The table's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 "Notes"; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 The Treasury's division, as the page heads the table; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 The table's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p4 "Notes"; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 The Treasury's division, as the page heads the table; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 The table's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 "Notes"; no rule.
-- akn:att_5__hc_1/p1 The Treasury's division, as the page heads the table; no rule.
-- akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 The table's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_5__hc_1/p6 "Notes"; no rule.

-- Each table prints the monthly combined salary of a full position, a row
-- per year of seniority (1 to 36) and a column per grade, in the order the
-- header prints them. A row is the year the teacher is in (convention
-- thresholds.seniority: "שנת ותק" N); the tables print no row past 36, and
-- none is made up (convention thresholds.missing-row). Below, each table
-- is written cell for cell as the corpus publishes it.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/t1 akn:att_2__hc_1/t1 akn:att_3__hc_1/t1 akn:att_4__hc_1/t1 akn:att_5__hc_1/t1
`the grades of the tables of 19.9.94` MEANS
    LIST "ביניים", "מדריך מקצועי: בלתי מוסמך", "מדריך מקצועי: מוסמך בפועל", "מדריך מקצועי: מוסמך",
         "מורה וגננת לא מוסמכים: ב", "מורה וגננת לא מוסמכים: א", "מורה וגננת לא מוסמכים: א+",
         "מורה וגננת לא מוסמכים: אא", "גננת מוסמכת", "מורה מוסמך", "מורה בכיר", "מורה ב.א.",
         "מורה מ.א.", "מורה ד\"ר"

`the seniority rows the tables of 19.9.94 print` MEANS 36

GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`
GIVETH A LIST OF LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the cells of` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `annex א' of 19.9.94` THEN `the cells of annex א' of the 1994 Histadrut agreement`
    WHEN `annex ב' of 19.9.94` THEN `the cells of annex ב' of the 1994 Histadrut agreement`
    WHEN `annex ג' of 19.9.94` THEN `the cells of annex ג' of the 1994 Histadrut agreement`
    WHEN `annex ד' of 19.9.94` THEN `the cells of annex ד' of the 1994 Histadrut agreement`
    WHEN `annex ה' of 19.9.94` THEN `the cells of annex ה' of the 1994 Histadrut agreement`

-- A table's cell at a seniority year (1 to 36) and a grade (its place in
-- the header, 1 to 14).
GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`
      `the year of seniority he is in` IS A NUMBER
      grade IS A NUMBER @desc its place among `the grades of the tables of 19.9.94`, from 1
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cell of the 19.9.94 table` a `the year of seniority he is in` grade IS
    IF     `the year of seniority he is in` AT LEAST 1
       AND `the year of seniority he is in` AT MOST `the seniority rows the tables of 19.9.94 print`
       AND grade AT LEAST 1
       AND grade AT MOST count `the grades of the tables of 19.9.94`
    THEN JUST (at (at (`the cells of` a) (`the year of seniority he is in` MINUS 1)) (grade MINUS 1))
    ELSE NOTHING

-- The combined salary of a full position on a day, by the table that
-- applies then (§4(א), as read above); from 1.1.96 the corrected annex ה'
-- (§4(ב)): the erosion result is the case's.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the year of seniority he is in` IS A NUMBER
      grade IS A NUMBER
      `the erosion result` IS A NUMBER @desc the January 1996 check's, as a fraction; read only from 1.1.96
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the combined salary of a full position under the tables of 19.9.94 on` d `the year of seniority he is in` grade `the erosion result` IS
    CONSIDER `the annex of 19.9.94 that applies on` d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST a THEN
        CONSIDER `the cell of the 19.9.94 table` a `the year of seniority he is in` grade
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST c THEN
            IF a EQUALS `annex ה' of 19.9.94`
            THEN JUST (`the corrected annex ה' cell of 19.9.94` c `the erosion result`)
            ELSE JUST c

-- What each table says it is in force from, under it: annex א' 1.1.94,
-- ב' 1.7.94, ג' 1.1.95, ד' 1.7.95 and ה' 1.1.96 "subject to §4(ב)"; annexes
-- ד' and ה' print that they include the increments of 1.2.94 (2.3%) and
-- 1.8.94 (3.7%) (F-hh-1994-d, §4(ג) above).
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_3__hc_1/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1/p5 akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1/p3
GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the day the 19.9.94 table prints it is in force from` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `annex א' of 19.9.94` THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994
    WHEN `annex ב' of 19.9.94` THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1994
    WHEN `annex ג' of 19.9.94` THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995
    WHEN `annex ד' of 19.9.94` THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1995
    WHEN `annex ה' of 19.9.94` THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1996

GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the increments the 19.9.94 table prints it includes` a IS
    IF a EQUALS `annex ד' of 19.9.94` OR a EQUALS `annex ה' of 19.9.94`
    THEN `the increments annexes ד' and ה' of 19.9.94 say they include`
    ELSE EMPTY

-- The notes under each table: the seniority in the table is computed so
-- that (1) each year's addition is a share of the combined salary of the
-- year before it, (2) at 5.0% from year 2 to year 7, 2.0% from 8 to 25 and
-- 1.0% from 26 on.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2/p4 akn:att_3__hc_1/p5 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2/p3 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2/p4 akn:att_4__hc_1/p6 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_2/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_2/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1/p7 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_2/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_2/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the seniority year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the seniority step of the tables of 19.9.94 into year` y IS
    BRANCH
        IF y `has reached the row from` 26 THEN 1%
        IF y `has reached the row from` 8 THEN 2%
        IF y `has reached the row from` 2 THEN 5%
        OTHERWISE 0

-- A year's cell as the notes build it from the first year's: each step on
-- the unrounded amount of the year before, the cell printed to the agora
-- (convention rounding.half, as the check of a printed figure).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the first year's cell` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cell the notes of 19.9.94 build for year` y `from` `the first year's cell` IS
    `to the agora` (foldl (GIVEN acc IS A NUMBER, k IS A NUMBER YIELD acc `increased by` (`the seniority step of the tables of 19.9.94 into year` k))
                          `the first year's cell`
                          (range 2 y))

-- (1)–(2): every cell of every table is the cell the notes build from the
-- first year's in its column — 2,520 cells, none missed to the agora.
GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`
GIVETH A LIST OF BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the cells of the 19.9.94 table set beside its notes` a IS
    concat (map (GIVEN g IS A NUMBER YIELD
                     map (GIVEN y IS A NUMBER YIELD
                              `the cell of the 19.9.94 table` a y g EQUALS
                                  JUST (`the cell the notes of 19.9.94 build for year` y `from` (at (at (`the cells of` a) 0) (g MINUS 1))))
                         (range 1 `the seniority rows the tables of 19.9.94 print`))
                (range 1 (count `the grades of the tables of 19.9.94`)))

`the annexes of 19.9.94` MEANS
    LIST `annex א' of 19.9.94`, `annex ב' of 19.9.94`, `annex ג' of 19.9.94`, `annex ד' of 19.9.94`, `annex ה' of 19.9.94`

`every cell of the tables of 19.9.94 is the one its notes build` MEANS
    all (GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94` YIELD and (`the cells of the 19.9.94 table set beside its notes` a)) `the annexes of 19.9.94`
#ASSERT `every cell of the tables of 19.9.94 is the one its notes build`
#ASSERT sum (map (GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94` YIELD count (`the cells of the 19.9.94 table set beside its notes` a)) `the annexes of 19.9.94`) EQUALS 2520
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94` YIELD count (`the cells of` a) EQUALS 36 AND all (GIVEN r IS A LIST OF NUMBER YIELD count r EQUALS 14) (`the cells of` a)) `the annexes of 19.9.94`

-- What each table prints it is in force from is the day §4(א) applies it
-- from, save annex ה', whose 1.1.96 is §4(ב)(4)'s and not §4(א)(5)'s
-- (F-hh-1994-a).
#ASSERT `the day the 19.9.94 table prints it is in force from` `annex ד' of 19.9.94` EQUALS `the day §4(א)(4) of 19.9.94 applies annex ד' from`
#ASSERT `the day the 19.9.94 table prints it is in force from` `annex ה' of 19.9.94` EQUALS `the day §4(ב)(4) of 19.9.94 applies the corrected annex ה' from`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94` YIELD `the annex of 19.9.94 that applies on` (`the day the 19.9.94 table prints it is in force from` a) EQUALS JUST a) `the annexes of 19.9.94`

-- The uncertified teachers' grade ב' stands still after annex ג': annexes
-- ד' and ה' print its column as annex ג' does, cell for cell, while every
-- other column rises.
GIVEN a IS AN `annex of the agreement of 19.9.94`, g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the column of the 19.9.94 table` a g IS
    map (GIVEN r IS A LIST OF NUMBER YIELD at r (g MINUS 1)) (`the cells of` a)

#ASSERT `the column of the 19.9.94 table` `annex ה' of 19.9.94` 5 EQUALS `the column of the 19.9.94 table` `annex ג' of 19.9.94` 5
#ASSERT `the column of the 19.9.94 table` `annex ד' of 19.9.94` 5 EQUALS `the column of the 19.9.94 table` `annex ג' of 19.9.94` 5
#ASSERT NOT (`the column of the 19.9.94 table` `annex ד' of 19.9.94` 6 EQUALS `the column of the 19.9.94 table` `annex ג' of 19.9.94` 6)

