    THEN `the educator's allowance rate` TIMES `the combined salary of a full position` TIMES `the pension percentage due`
    ELSE `the educator's allowance rate` TIMES `the combined salary of a full position` TIMES `the weighted position` TIMES `the pension percentage due`

